{
  "buildCommand": "npm run build",
  "outputDirectory": "dist",
  "installCommand": "npm install",
  "redirects": [
    {
      "source": "/pages/seen.html",
      "destination": "https://tbd-compass-app.vercel.app/",
      "permanent": false
    },
    {
      "_comment": "模板檔案裡的 compass 出口一律指向這裡，不直接寫 compass 網域。理由：模板是會被下載的靜態檔，網域搬到 app.tbd… 之後，已下載的副本改不到；走轉址則只要改這一行。與 /pages/seen.html 同樣用 302（permanent: false），因為目的地本來就是暫時網域。查詢字串（utm_*）Vercel 會自動帶過去。",
      "source": "/pages/placement.html",
      "destination": "https://tbd-compass-app.vercel.app/placement",
      "permanent": false
    },
    {
      "source": "/pages/plans.html",
      "destination": "/pages/services.html#plans",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/pages/audience.html",
      "destination": "/pages/services.html",
      "permanent": true
    },
    {
      "source": "/pages.html",
      "destination": "/pages/services.html",
      "permanent": true
    }
  ]
}
